/* =========================================================
   FONTS — Literata (headlines/display) + Satoshi (body/UI)
   Embedded locally. Both families now carry true static
   weights through 300-700 (+ italics); Satoshi also has a
   true 900 Black. Nothing above a family's heaviest cut maps
   onto that heaviest real file rather than a synthetic bold.
   ========================================================= */
@font-face{
  font-family:'Literata'; font-style:normal; font-weight:300;
  src:url(data:font/woff2;base64,);
  font-display:swap;
}
